      "evidenceText": "Workshop video: OSINT tools and approaches for connecting websites together This website uses cookies Read our Privacy policy and Terms of use for more information . Accept Customize Decline Workshop video: OSINT tools and approaches for connecting websites together Members can access the video, slides, and transcript Craig Silverman Aug 7, 2025 I held Indicator’s second members-only workshop last Friday. We looked at some of the tools and techniques outlined in the recently-published Indicator guide to connecting websites together using OSINT tools and methods . I also gave a hands-on demo of Silent Push , a great tool (with a free community edition!) for investigating website content and infrastructure. Below is a video of the session as well as links to a transcript, the slides, and a document with AI-generated notes. Our next workshop will be August 29 at 12 pm ET. Please sign up as a paid member so you can access the materials and join us later this month! Upgrade to read the rest. Become a paying member of Indicator to access all of our content and our monthly members-only workshop. Support independent media while building your skills. Upgrade A membership gets you : Everything we publish, plus archival content, including the Academic Library and our Resources Live monthly workshops and access to all recordings Keep Reading Indicator is your essential guide to understanding and investigating digital deception. Subscribe for free I consent to receive newsletters via email. Sign up Terms of service . ABOUT ARCHIVE UPGRADE window.__remixContext = {\"basename\":\"/\",\"future\":{\"v3_fetcherPersist\":false,\"v3_relativeSplatPath\":false,\"v3_throwAbortReason\":false,\"v3_routeConfig\":false,\"v3_singleFetch\":false,\"v3_lazyRouteDiscovery\":false,\"unstable_optimizeDeps\":false},\"isSpaMode\":false,\"state\":{\"loaderData\":{\"root\":{\"site\":{\"id\":\"307061ed-0223-42d6-b0bb-9db60103a5c8\",\"theme_rules\":{\"section\":{\"background_color\"