      "pageTitle": "Upgrade to an Indicator membership | Indicator",
      "pageDescription": "Indicator publishes original reporting, in-depth investigations, and practical OSINT resources and tutorials about digital deception.",
      "evidenceText": "Upgrade to an Indicator membership | Indicator This website uses cookies Read our Privacy policy and Terms of use for more information . Accept Customize Decline Join 1,000+ Pro members Insights. Skills. tools. Get full access to exclusive reporting, expert intelligence about digital deception, and OSINT training Upgrade now Who uses Indicator We serve professionals and engaged citizens that are on the front lines of the fight against digital deception INVESTIGATORS & JOURNALISTS Master OSINT techniques used in award-winning investigations. Our Guides walk you through the exact methods used by us and leading practitioners to background people and companies, expose AI nudifier networks, track coordinated manipulation campaigns, and hold platforms accountable. Start with: The Indicator guide to connecting websites together using OSINT tools TRUST & SAFETY PROFESSIONALS Surface threats before they hit your internal dashboards. Our reporting regularly identifies cross-platform abuse patterns, policy gaps, and emerging vectors— helping digital safety professionals take action and adapt or develop policy. Start with: AI Nudifiers continue to reach millions and make millions RESEARCHERS & ACADEMICS Access our in-depth audits of platform interventions and our academic library of curated studies on misinformation, AI-generated content, and more. Plus, we share original data and methodologies from our investigations. Start with: The Academic Library Member Benefits A paid Indicator membership equips you with practical skills and exclusive intelligence to make you better at your job. Intelligence & Reporting Exclusive reporting and investigations that expose deceptive operations and reveal the actors manipulating the information environment. Systemic audits of digital platforms that seek to quantify company compliance with stated policies, executive commitments, and regulatory requirements. Skills A monthly workshop that offers live walkthroughs of investigations, tools, and techniques. Plus, access to our full archive of workshop videos, slides, and transcripts. Hands-on guides to OSINT and digital investigative tools and techniques that help both professionals and motivated citizens become better investigators. Coming up: access to two self-paced online courses on OSINT and investigating digital safety. Founding Members only : A 30 min one-on-one or small group consultation or presentation per year delivered by Craig or Alexios. Tools OSINT Navigator, a database that allows investigators and researchers to search through thousands of open source intelligence tools to find the right one for your investigation. Interactive dashboards that we build as part of our investigations, including the AI Notes dashboard and Grok, is this true? trackers. Coming up: a suite of tools to power your investigations with AI part of a dedicated Lab tier , and structured access to the data underlying our investigations. Upgrade your skills and knowledge Start your membership now Join the Lab LARGE GROUP SUBSCRIPTIONS Interested in a bulk subscription package for your organization or a group discount for your class or conference? Please email us: [email protected] Discounted memberships We understand that $12.95/mo. is a substantial amount for some people. If you're between jobs, located in a lower-income economy, or otherwise unable to pay the full amount, please email [email protected] for a 1-year discounted membership rate. Indicator is your essential guide to understanding and investigating digital deception. Subscribe for free I consent to receive newsletters via email. Sign up Terms of service . ABOUT ARCHIVE UPGRADE window.__remixContext = {\"basename\":\"/\",\"future\":{\"v3_fetcherPersist\":false,\"v3_relativeSplatPath\":false,\"v3_throwAbortReason\":false,\"v3_routeConfig\":false,\"v3_singleFetch\":false,\"v3_lazyRouteDiscovery\":false,\"unstable_optimizeDeps\":false},\"isSpaMode\":false,\"state\":{\"loaderData\":{\"root\":