      "id": "12846ba0fee78baab3ee06d0ee60b7e5fc8322a9ae1c266ea7f5c39ab63fae62",
      "title": "The Open Notebook + Retraction Watch — Research Accountability Reporting Fellowship (rolling; confirmar vagas)",
      "url": "https://www.theopennotebook.com/2026/09/28/announcing-the-first-research-accountability-reporting-fellows-and-a-new-slate-of-trainings",
