      "id": "333d9969a641b7f91f1637238557a22ef0525ee4d100286a980ab3c3cb85bbc0",
      "title": "Mastercard Foundation EdTech Fellowship Uganda Cohort 2",
      "url": "https://opportunitydesk.org/2026/11/03/mastercard-foundation-edtech-fellowship-uganda-cohort-2",
